)\" fontSize=\"15\" fontFamily=\"Courier New\" italic=\"false\" strikethrough=\"false\" underline=\"false\">&quot;.&quot;</span></strong><strong><span color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\" fontSize=\"15\" fontFamily=\"Courier New\" italic=\"false\" strikethrough=\"false\" underline=\"false\">);</span></strong></p>\n          <p textAlign=\"left\" lineSpacing=\"multiple:1.2\" defaultTabSize=\"72\"><strong><span color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\" fontSize=\"15\" fontFamily=\"Courier New\" italic=\"false\" strikethrough=\"false\" underline=\"false\">    }</span></strong></p>\n          <p textAlign=\"left\" lineSpacing=\"multiple:1.2\" defaultTabSize=\"72\"><strong><span color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\" fontSize=\"15\" fontFamily=\"Courier New\" italic=\"false\" strikethrough=\"false\" underline=\"false\">    exit(0);</span></strong></p>\n          <p textAlign=\"left\" lineSpacing=\"multiple:1.2\" defaultTabSize=\"72\"><strong><span color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\" fontSize=\"15\" fontFamily=\"Courier New\" italic=\"false\" strikethrough=\"false\" underline=\"false\">}</span></strong></p>\n        </content>\n      </shape>"}, {"action": "block_replace", "block_id": "bXm", "replacement": "<shape width=\"109.99897637795276\" height=\"29.081259842519685\" topLeftX=\"580.0010236220472\" topLeftY=\"504.00000000000006\" type=\"text\" id=\"bXm\">\n        <content verticalAlign=\"top\" paddingTop=\"3.6\" paddingBottom=\"3.6\" paddingLeft=\"7.2\" paddingRight=\"7.2\" fontSize=\"16\" fontFamily=\"思源黑体\" color=\"rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)\" textAlign=\"left\" autoFit=\"shape-auto-fit\" wrap=\"false\">\n          <p textAlign=\"left\" lineSpacing=\"multiple:1.2\" defaultTabSize=\"72\"><strong><span color=\"rgba(127, 127, 127, 1)\" fontSize=\"18\" fontFamily=\"Calibri\" italic=\"false\" strikethrough=\"false\" underline=\"false\">sigsuspend.c</span></strong></p>\n        </content>\n      </shape>"}]